Cloud, that helps

00:31:24.160 --> 00:31:25.970
you to create that VPN tunnel.

00:31:25.970 --> 00:31:27.760
So there is already
a VPN tunnel set up.

00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:29.560
There is already
Stealthwatch Cloud,

00:31:29.560 --> 00:31:32.110
which is monitoring this
connection from a security

00:31:32.110 --> 00:31:32.759
perspective.

00:31:32.759 --> 00:31:35.050
And we'll talk about the
details about that integration

00:31:35.050 --> 00:31:35.740
later as well.

00:31:35.740 --> 00:31:38.830
But that's all set up as part
of this tunnel between these two

00:31:38.830 --> 00:31:40.950
environments.

00:31:40.950 --> 00:31:43.700
So as we see into
the demo, we'll

00:31:43.700 --> 00:31:46.790
see essentially all of these
services that are running will

00:31:46.790 --> 00:31:48.800
have a sidecar proxy within it.

00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:52.940
And that essentially helps
to discover the services

00:31:52.940 --> 00:31:55.100
across the GKE and the
on-prem environment.

00:31:55.100 --> 00:31:55.850
So enough of this.

